From 67446833f34345d74c9da495dbbd28a96d62adfa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Lonkwitz <mawelo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:44:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] [AI generated] AIX: RPM packaging (spec, launcher),
 probes and check tools

* tools/aix/rpm: btop.spec (layout /opt/btop, symlink /usr/bin/btop, MD5 file
  digests and gzip payload so that rpm.rte 4.9 can read the package),
  btop.sh launcher (adds --force-utf when no UTF-8 locale is active, defaults
  TERM to xterm-256color), build_rpm.pl (stages the file tree once, builds RPM
  and an equivalent tar archive, writes rpm-info.txt), README.AIX.
* tools/aix/probes: perfstat_sizes.cpp (structure sizes across releases),
  cxxrt_probe.cpp (C++23 runtime smoke test), pthread_probe.c (static mutex
  initializer across releases), libcall_probe.c (___strlen64/___strcmp64).
* tools/aix/check_imports.pl: imports of an XCOFF binary against the export
  list of a target release.
* tools/aix/ansi_render.pl: render a terminal recording as a text screen.
* tools/aix/shim/strftime_l_shim.c: LDR_PRELOAD64 shim used only for the
  diagnosis of the 7.2-on-7.1 failure.
